{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人劉愷威自2018年與楊冪離婚後，曾與內地女星李曉峰相戀，但戀情已於今年4月悄然落幕。</p><p>近日，劉愷威被爆與年輕20歲的黎紀君拍拖，引發網民熱議。</p><p>兩人認愛後毫不避忌，經常出雙入對高調放閃。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;這對</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.420528+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552114+00:00","content_hash":"e2267aabf66144c0c06dfe213b920ebbad8b033f44f4e2d34b59d249ccd8ac43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}